WEBVTT

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.320
Hi, my name is Cheryl Foster and I am

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:06.960
here to tell you about my friend and my

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:08.400
sister in Christ, Keisha.

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:11.060
Keisha is an amazing human being.

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:14.760
I met her three years ago when I entered

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.580
into the Denton Freedom House.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:18.520
Keisha is a WOW there.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:21.380
She volunteers her time every single Friday.

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:26.560
She would come to the house and she

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:29.900
would bring joy and she would bring laughter and

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:32.080
we would play games, which was amazing.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.260
But on top of that, she would talk to

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:36.100
us about the Lord and talk to us about

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:38.380
the Bible and she would pray over us.

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:42.500
And just give us words of wisdom and encouragement,

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:45.180
which was always amazing.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:49.800
Keisha may not realize that when I came into

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:52.960
the house I had a lot of unforgiveness for

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:56.720
multiple things and multiple people.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:59.660
And she was instrumental in helping me find a

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:02.880
way to get past the unforgiveness and actually give

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:04.900
that to the Lord and leave it with the

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:08.260
Lord. So that I could forgive the very people

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:11.200
that I didn't feel deserved to be forgiven.

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:18.420
And her words of wisdom and her insight

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:22.300
helped me to do that.

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:25.140
It helped put me in a trajectory to actually

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:28.780
be able to forgive.

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:31.440
I will always love her for that.

00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:34.140
So many of us give up on our dreams

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:37.520
or our goals because we don't see a way

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:39.840
or we think things are too hard and that

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:41.200
has never stopped her.

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:44.840
She is so determined and I am so proud

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:48.180
of her for following through and

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:51.040
actually making this a reality for

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:54.580
not just herself but for women

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:56.420
who are in need.

00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:58.580
She is making this a reality for them.

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:06.140
If you are thinking about sponsoring

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:09.700
her ministry or this home or if

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:13.040
you are thinking about being involved in any way

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:16.000
shape or form, you will not be disappointed.

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:17.440
You will
